        "cinderfall": {
            "incomplete": "'Ignores 5 points of resistance' has no hook: pf2e's resistance-ignoring mechanism (precision damage, or specific weapon properties like a rune) is never expressed as a flat 'ignore N points,' and no generic rule element for it exists (same gap already flagged on the equipment pass's ammo cards). The once-per-week remote-kill-switch fired by a third party targets the wielder from outside the item entirely -- no selector exists for an item harming its own bearer on someone else's trigger with no save.",
